      "section": "Greased-for-life bearing lubrication",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 740.80297,
        "r": 254.71200000000002,
        "b": 727.41097
      },
      "content": "Greased-for-life bearing lubrication",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0752",
      "reading_order": 872,
      "section": "Greased-for-life bearing lubrication",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.002,
        "t": 724.12184,
        "r": 548.8420000000003,
        "b": 688.88184
      },
      "content": "The bearing manufacturer fills greased-for-life bearings with grease and seals them at the factory. You do not need to lubricate or seal these bearings. Refer to the Maintenance chapter for re-greasing and maintenance procedures for these bearings."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0753",
      "reading_order": 873,
      "section": "Shaft-sealing options",
      "bbox": {
