      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00003999999998,
        "t": 649.60184,
        "r": 547.5400400000003,
        "b": 626.36184
      },
      "content": "In most cases, the manufacturer seals the shaft before shipping the pump. If  your pump does not have a sealed shaft, see the Shaft-seal maintenance section in the Maintenance chapter."
    },
    {
