      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00004,
        "t": 112.94640000000004,
        "r": 404.48004000000003,
        "b": 101.70640000000003
      },
      "content": "The factory does not install the packing, lantern ring, or split gland."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0776",
      "reading_order": 898,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00008,
        "t": 97.94640000000004,
        "r": 552.7600800000002,
        "b": 62.70640000000003
      },
      "content": "These parts are included with the pump in the box of fittings. Before you start the pump, you must install the packing, lantern ring, and split gland according to the Packed stuffing box maintenance section in the Maintenance chapter."
    }
